{"ticker":"SPOT","updated":"2026-10-23T07:51:00Z","profile":{"longName":"Spotify Technology S.A.","shortName":"Spotify Technology S.A.","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Internet Content & Information","country":"Sweden","website":"https://www.spotify.com","fullTimeEmployees":7000,"marketCap":119991271424,"trailingPE":33.54368,"forwardPE":33.746086,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.624594,"pegRatio":1.51,"targetMeanPrice":628.1376,"targetHighPrice":749.83203,"targetLowPrice":459.12415,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":37,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.139,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.32766998,"operatingMargins":0.13712,"profitMargins":0.18434,"totalRevenue":18112999424,"beta":1.614,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":683.96,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":405.0,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Spotify Technology S.A., together with its subsidiaries, provides audio streaming subscription services worldwide. It operates in two segments, Premium and Ad-Supported. The Premium segment offers online and offline streaming access to its catalog of music and podcasts, including video, lossless music, and audiobooks in select markets through subscription offerings primarily sold directly to end users and partners. The Ad-Supported segment provides limited on-demand online access to its catalog of music and online and offline access to its catalog of podcasts on computers, tablets, mobile devices, and other smart devices. The company also offers sales, distribution and marketing, contract research and development, and customer and other support services. Spotify Technology S.A. was incorporated in 2006 and is headquartered in Stockholm, Sweden.","summary_zh":"Spotify Technology S.A. 及其子公司在全球提供音訊串流訂閱服務。它分為兩個部分：高級部分和廣告支援部分。高級部分透過主要直接銷售給最終用戶和合作夥伴的訂閱產品，提供對其音樂和播客目錄的線上和離線串流媒體訪問，包括特定市場的影片、無損音樂和有聲讀物。廣告支援部分提供對其音樂目錄的有限點播線上訪問，以及在電腦、平板電腦、行動裝置和其他智慧型裝置上對其播客目錄的線上和離線存取。該公司還提供銷售、分銷和行銷、合約研發以及客戶和其他支援服務。 Spotify Technology S.A. 成立於 2006 年，總部位於瑞典斯德哥